      "title": "Career Center",
      "description": "Career Center | Recruitment Join Our Talent Community Facebook LinkedIn Email X Copy URL Custodian Housekeeping Staff Full-Time Physical Plant, Ashland, VA, US 30+ days ago Requisition ID: 1695 Apply Salary: $16.00 Hourly Randolph-Macon College invites applications for a full-time Custodian to join our Custodial Team. Why work at Randolph-Macon College? Join a supportive campus community while enjoying a comprehensive benefits package that includes medical, dental and vision insurance, a College-matched retirement plan, tuition benefits, generous paid time off, parental leave, disability coverage, life insurance, and wellness programs. Responsibilities Cleaning of academic, administrative, and student housing areas. Qualifications High school diploma or GED and a valid driver’s license required with satisfactory motor vehicle record by insurance standards. Lifting or moving of materials up to 50lbs is required. Applicants with cleaning experience and familiarity with associated equipment is preferred. Schedule Monday - Friday, 6am-2:30pm. Required to be on-call one week out of the month. Position is deemed as Essential Personnel, requiring availability during emergency situations or periods of disruption. Comprehensive benefits package At Randolph-Macon College, we offer a comprehensive benefits package designed to support you and your family, including: Medical, dental, and vision insurance Retirement plan with a College match College tuition benefits for eligible employees and dependents Generous paid time off, including vacation, sick, personal, and holiday leave Parental leave Employer-provided life insurance and AD&D coverage Short-term and long-term disability coverage Wellness programs and employee well-being resources The College Founded in 1830, Randolph-Macon has about 1800 students and is located in Ashland, VA, a residential community 15 miles north of Richmond and 90 miles south of Washington D.C., thereby having all the benefits f