    "https://workforcenow.adp.com/mascsr/default/mdf/recruitment/recruitment.html?cid=0885b537-c9f5-47f8-aa4f-0ad7bbebf412&ccId=9200900703747_2&jobId=9204275932187_1&lang=en_US": {
      "title": "Career Center",
      "description": "Career Center | Recruitment Join Our Talent Community Facebook LinkedIn Email X Copy URL Nursing Adjunct Faculty Nursing-Faculty Salary Nursing, Ashland, VA, US 30+ days ago Requisition ID: 1606 Apply Salary Range: $3,000.00 To $6,200.00 Annually Randolph-Macon College (RMC) invites applications for adjunct faculty in the Department of Nursing to teach during the 2026-2027 academic year. All classroom, lab, and clinical teaching is in person on the RMC campus or at clinical sites in the metro Richmond region. Applicants with clinical expertise in all areas are invited to apply to join our team. Tenure track and clinical track options are available for full-time positions. Faculty are provided individualized mentorship for success as an educator and as part of a faculty team in meeting the mission of our department, ”to provide a transformative education grounded in the liberal arts to develop resilient nurse leaders prepared to practice innovatively within a dynamic healthcare environment.” Our BSN program fully integrates Apple technology products for a student-centered learning experience which produces quality practice-ready new graduates. Minimum Faculty Qualifications : Unencumbered licensure as a registered nurse in the Commonwealth of Virginia or multistate licensure, Virginia eligible; A master's degree in nursing; Clinical expertise in a specific clinical nursing area (medical/surgical, adult health, women’s health, pediatrics, mental health, population health). Preferred Qualifications : Prior teaching experience preferred. Faculty in the Department of Nursing are required to : Facilitate learning, evaluate and coach students in the classroom, laboratory, simulation, and/or clinical settings to promote student success; Support the departmental mission centered on excellence in teaching and learning through quality teaching/learning experiences; Communicate effectively with course coordinators, faculty, assistant director, and director to achieve course and program outcomes; and Demonstrate the core values of caring, civility, inclusivity, excellence, and integrity. To apply, submit a cover letter of interest and current resume/CV to http://bit.ly/4pGwuzf . Review of applications starts immediately. If you have questions about the position, email Dr. Cindy Rubenstein, Director of Nursing, at cynthiarubenstein@rmc.edu . Randolph-Macon College does not discriminate on the basis of race, color, creed, religion, age, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, marital status, disability, or veteran status in its education or employment programs or activities. Back Apply Copyright © 2026, ADP, Inc. All rights reserved. Powered by Privacy | Legal | Requirements | Artificial Intelligence To manage your preferences, click here Powered by Please switch to a supported browser listed here ,\n      or some features may not work correctly. Our site uses cookies and similar technologies to remember your visit, collect statistics of visits and tailor our site to your interests. They also enable to offer tailored advertising and to link to social networks. For more information or to set your cookie preferences, you may at any time use our tool « Cookie Preferences » at the bottom of our site. Cookie Privacy Statement Set your preferences Deny Agree and proceed Opt-Out Request Honored Set your cookie preferences ADP values your privacy. We provide you with this intuitive tool to help you understand what information may be collected by cookies, by whom, what cookies are used for and to give you control over how the information is being collected and used. For more information on our data policies, please visit our Privacy Statement.\n\nPlease choose whether this site may use Functional, Analytics and/or Advertising cookies, as described below: Select All Required Always Active These cookies are required to enable core site functionality. Functional Functional These cookies are used to enable enhanced functionality and personalization features. Analytics Analytics These cookies allow us to analyze site usage so we can measure and improve performance. Advertising Advertising These cookies are used by advertising companies to serve ads that are relevant to your interests. Back Button Cookie List Search Icon Filter Icon Clear checkbox label label Apply Cancel Consent Leg.Interest checkbox label label checkbox label label checkbox label label Unselect All Save Changes"
